Seam: chrome/browser/resource_coordinator/BUILD.gn, source_set("impl") -- the
      target tab_lifecycle_unit.cc builds in, inside the `if (!is_android)`
      block that also lists the file itself.
Why: GN wiring for patch 0184. The hook includes an //arcium/browser header,
     and this target reaches Arcium only through //chrome/browser/ui, whose
     dep on //arcium/ui/browser is private (patch 0010), so `gn check`
     rejects the include even though ninja accepts it.

     No cycle: //arcium/browser depends on nothing under //chrome, so
     `gn gen` accepts the graph with this dep added.
Delegates to: nothing. GN wiring carries no call.

diff --git a/chrome/browser/resource_coordinator/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/resource_coordinator/BUILD.gn
index d9f3077b82..2cb0cd5d44 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/resource_coordinator/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/resource_coordinator/BUILD.gn
@@ -126,6 +126,8 @@ source_set("impl") {
     ]
 
     deps += [
+      # Arcium: tab_lifecycle_unit.cc calls arcium/browser/profile_partition.h.
+      "//arcium/browser",
       "//chrome/browser/devtools",
       "//chrome/browser/memory",
       "//chrome/browser/permissions",
